cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Language Model Hallucination Detection via Entropy Divergence"
abstract: >-
  LLM hallucination detection using single-pass entropy statistics and
  divergence from calibrated entropy distributions. Combines five
  attention-pattern feature families (Shannon entropy, lookback ratio,
  frequency domain, spectral Laplacian, cross-layer KL divergence) with
  single-pass token-entropy baselines, an isotonic-calibration plus
  Mahalanobis-divergence detector, and a black-box detector that works
  from only the top-K logprobs a commercial completion API exposes.
  Trained on a self-labeled data pipeline.
authors:
